{{!
    @template tool_vae/export_warnings

    The lines an export or a backup left out of its archive, under the sentence that opens the notice. The list breaks a
    line after its opening tag and after each item, as html_writer::alist() did.

    Every text comes from the context, given by tool_vae\output\export_warnings. The template holds no logic. Every value
    is escaped (double braces): none of them is HTML.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * lead - string, the sentence that opens the notice
    * lines - list of {text}: each line left out

    Example context (json):
    {
        "lead": "The archive was made, but some lines were left out:",
        "lines": [{"text": "RNCP36832-<b>x: the rank does not match."}]
    }
}}
<p>{{lead}}</p><ul>
{{#lines}}<li>{{text}}</li>
{{/lines}}</ul>
